WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.713 --> 00:00:12.774
loved playing tricks on April Fools' Day.

2
00:00:13.594 --> 00:00:16.276
She hurried to get to Kids Central before the other kids.

3
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:19.277
Soon Nina came in.

4
00:00:20.918 --> 00:00:22.979
She pulled out a chair to sit beside Izzie.

5
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.341
"Aah!" Nina screamed.

6
00:00:27.242 --> 00:00:29.203
A huge black spider was on her seat!

7
00:00:30.423 --> 00:00:31.184
Izzie laughed.

8
00:00:35.084 --> 00:00:35.364
"April Fool!"

9
00:00:35.404 --> 00:00:36.785
She picked up the rubber spider.

10
00:00:37.585 --> 00:00:38.586
Nina laughed too.

11
00:00:38.606 --> 00:00:41.227
"That was a good one!

12
00:00:41.848 --> 00:00:42.908
You scared me!"

13
00:00:43.889 --> 00:00:45.530
Jason and Ethan arrived next.

14
00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:48.531
Jason hung up his backpack.

15
00:00:48.551 --> 00:00:52.353
"Watch this," Izzie whispered to Nina.

16
00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.095
Jason and Ethan sat down.

17
00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.197
Izzie slipped something into Jason's backpack.

18
00:01:00.678 --> 00:01:03.119
Then she walked to the window and stared outside.

19
00:01:05.152 --> 00:01:05.733
"Rib-bit! Rib-bit!"

20
00:01:07.034 --> 00:01:08.094
Izzie spun around.

21
00:01:08.114 --> 00:01:10.336
"What was that noise?

22
00:01:11.157 --> 00:01:12.898
It sounded like a frog!"

23
00:01:13.879 --> 00:01:15.720
Everyone looked at Jason's backpack.

24
00:01:16.561 --> 00:01:21.245
"Rib-bit!" Jason went to his backpack and slowly reached inside.

25
00:01:21.265 --> 00:01:24.087
"It's not a frog!

26
00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:27.670
It's a Jason held out a walkie-talkie.

27
00:01:28.711 --> 00:01:30.012
Izzie held up another one.

28
00:01:34.124 --> 00:01:36.245
"Rib-bit!" "Here comes Bobby," Ethan whispered.

29
00:01:36.265 --> 00:01:38.147
"Let's play a trick on him!"

30
00:01:39.187 --> 00:01:42.169
Izzie quickly pressed a quarter to the floor with sticky stuff.

31
00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:44.851
Everyone watched as Bobby came in.

32
00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:48.374
"Hey! I found a quarter!"

33
00:01:49.054 --> 00:01:50.775
He bent down and tried to pick it up.

34
00:01:53.017 --> 00:01:53.877
But it was stuck!

35
00:01:54.838 --> 00:01:58.700
All the kids laughed at the trick.

36
00:01:59.441 --> 00:02:00.642
Miss Shelly laughed too.

37
00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:03.664
"Playing tricks is fun," she said.

38
00:02:04.292 --> 00:02:06.253
"As long as it doesn't go too far.

39
00:02:06.914 --> 00:02:09.995
Never play tricks that hurt other people's feelings."

40
00:02:10.856 --> 00:02:13.837
"Or tricks that damage property," Ethan added.

41
00:02:13.858 --> 00:02:16.639
"That's right," Miss Shelly said.

42
00:02:16.659 --> 00:02:20.161
"Can we play more April Fool's Day tricks?"

43
00:02:20.681 --> 00:02:21.402
Izzie asked.

44
00:02:21.422 --> 00:02:25.844
"Actually, we're going to make an April Fools' treat."

45
00:02:26.965 --> 00:02:29.006
Miss Shelly put a skillet on the hot plate.

46
00:02:30.487 --> 00:02:32.288
She pointed to some slices of cake.

47
00:02:33.008 --> 00:02:35.229
"Everyone take a slice of pound cake.

48
00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:38.271
Butter it on both sides."

49
00:02:39.872 --> 00:02:41.113
Nina read from the board.

50
00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:44.915
"Now we brown our slice in the skillet."

51
00:02:46.155 --> 00:02:47.156
Ethan went first.

52
00:02:47.176 --> 00:02:49.637
"It looks like toast!"

53
00:02:51.098 --> 00:02:52.719
"Right," Miss Shelly said.

54
00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:57.382
After everyone finished making the toast, it was time to make the egg.

55
00:02:58.422 --> 00:03:01.244
The kids spooned vanilla yogurt on top of the pound cake.

56
00:03:02.396 --> 00:03:05.498
"Spread it into the shape of an egg white," Bobby read.

57
00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:08.220
"Then put the apricot half in the middle."

58
00:03:09.261 --> 00:03:10.141
Nina grinned.

59
00:03:10.161 --> 00:03:13.384
"It looks like a fried egg on toast!"

60
00:03:13.404 --> 00:03:17.727
"It's like dessert for breakfast," Bobby said.

61
00:03:17.747 --> 00:03:21.249
"This will be a great trick to play at home!"

62
00:03:21.629 --> 00:03:22.270
Izzie said.

63
00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:31.116
"Oh, speaking of home She ran to her backpack and came back with some sandwich cookies.

64
00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.361
"Who wants a cookie?"

65
00:03:37.623 --> 00:03:39.224
I do maybe."

66
00:03:40.004 --> 00:03:41.005
Ethan took a cookie.

67
00:03:42.226 --> 00:03:44.387
He opened it to check for anything suspicious.

68
00:03:44.407 --> 00:03:49.069
"Looks okay," He licked the icing.

69
00:03:49.089 --> 00:03:51.851
"Yuck! It's toothpaste!"

70
00:03:51.871 --> 00:03:54.112
"April Fool!"

71
00:03:54.872 --> 00:03:55.613
Izzie laughed.

72
00:03:55.633 --> 00:03:59.855
"Let's go outside," Miss Shelly said.

73
00:04:01.324 --> 00:04:03.726
"Izzie, will you get a basketball from the closet?"

74
00:04:07.409 --> 00:04:08.850
Izzie opened the closet door.

75
00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:11.212
"Eek!" she cried.

76
00:04:12.233 --> 00:04:14.715
Then she laughed.

77
00:04:14.735 --> 00:04:17.237
"That's a good one, Miss Shelly!"

78
00:04:17.778 --> 00:04:19.699
The other kids crowded behind Izzie.

79
00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:24.944
In the closet all the balls had googly eyes!
